          "text": "跨部门协作中，应明确数据质量问题的首问责任部门，避免推诿。协作结果应纳入部门年度考核。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            395.19999999999993,
            492.5,
            411.4749999999999
          ],
          "block_id": "t00009",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "数据质量培训应注重案例教学，使用真实脱敏数据演示常见错误及修复方法，提升培训实效。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            417.4749999999999,
            482.0,
            433.7499999999999
          ],
          "block_id": "t00010",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "监控预警阈值应基于历史数据分析和业务容忍度设定，并定期回顾调整，避免误报或漏报。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            439.7499999999999,
            419.0,
            456.02499999999986
          ],
          "block_id": "t00011",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "数据质量负责人应具备跨部门协调能力，机构应赋予其必要的资源调配权限。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            462.02499999999986,
            461.0,
            478.29999999999984
          ],
          "block_id": "t00012",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "评估抽样应保证随机性和代表性，样本量应满足统计要求，并记录抽样过程以备核查。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            484.29999999999984,
            419.0,
            500.5749999999998
          ],
          "block_id": "t00013",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "对于共享数据，提供方和使用方应签订质量协议，明确质量要求和责任边界。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            506.5749999999998,
            440.0,
            522.8499999999998
          ],
          "block_id": "t00014",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "数据质量报告应简明扼要，突出关键问题和改进建议，便于决策层快速掌握情况。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            528.8499999999998,
            461.0,
            545.1249999999998
          ],
          "block_id": "t00015",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "机构应建立数据质量问题的闭环管理机制，从发现、登记、整改到验证形成完整记录。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            551.1249999999998,
            387.5,
            567.3999999999997
          ],
          "block_id": "t00016",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "数据质量指标应与业务绩效指标区分，避免因考核压力导致数据造假。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            573.3999999999997,
            419.0,
            589.6749999999997
          ],
          "block_id": "t00017",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "新系统上线前应进行数据质量影响评估，确保数据迁移和接口符合质量要求。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            595.6749999999997,
            408.5,
            611.9499999999997
          ],
          "block_id": "t00018",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "数据质量培训应覆盖所有接触数据的岗位，包括一线采集人员和管理人员。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            617.9499999999997,
            345.5,
            634.2249999999997
          ],
          "block_id": "t00019",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "监控系统应具备日志审计功能，确保预警和处理过程可追溯。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            640.2249999999997,
            377.0,
            656.4999999999997
          ],
          "block_id": "t00020",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "跨部门协作会议应形成纪要，明确行动项和完成时限，并跟踪落实。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            662.4999999999997,
            366.5,
            678.7749999999996
          ],
          "block_id": "t00021",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "数据质量评估可引入第三方机构进行独立审计，提高评估公信力。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            684.7749999999996,
            377.0,
            701.0499999999996
          ],
          "block_id": "t00022",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "机构应定期开展数据质量文化宣传活动，表彰优秀实践，推广经验。",
          "parent_id": "h0005",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        }
      ]
