            62.0,
            491.6749999999999,
            545.0,
            507.9499999999999
          ],
          "block_id": "t00025",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "公共服务机构应建立数据质量评估与监控体系，定期对数据的准确性、完整性、一致性、及时性和可用性",
          "parent_id": "h0007",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            507.9499999999999,
            545.0,
            524.2249999999999
          ],
          "block_id": "t00025",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "进行评估。评估应采用定量与定性相结合的方法，覆盖数据采集、处理、存储和共享等环节。监控应实现",
          "parent_id": "h0007",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            524.2249999999999,
            408.5,
            540.4999999999999
          ],
          "block_id": "t00025",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "自动化，及时发现异常并触发预警。评估结果应形成报告，作为改进依据。",
          "parent_id": "h0007",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            66.0,
            546.4999999999999,
            181.34400022029877,
            565.0999999999999
          ],
          "block_id": "h0008",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "2.1 数据质量评估指标",
          "parent_id": "h0007",
          "level": 3,
          "size": 12,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": "18384a"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            569.0999999999999,
            545.0,
            585.3749999999999
          ],
          "block_id": "t00026",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "数据质量评估指标应包括准确性、完整性、一致性、及时性、唯一性和有效性等维度。各机构可根据业务",
          "parent_id": "h0008",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            585.3749999999999,
            534.5,
            601.6499999999999
          ],
          "block_id": "t00026",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "特点细化指标，并设定目标值。指标应可量化、可验证，并定期评审更新。评估指标应覆盖关键数据元",
          "parent_id": "h0008",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            601.6499999999999,
            366.5,
            617.9249999999998
          ],
          "block_id": "t00026",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "素，并与业务目标对齐。指标数据应来源可靠，采集方法应规范。",
          "parent_id": "h0008",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            72.0,
            623.9249999999998,
            175.89500024914742,
            640.9749999999998
          ],
          "block_id": "h0009",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "2.1.1 准确性评估方法",
          "parent_id": "h0008",
          "level": 4,
          "size": 11,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": "18384a"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            644.9749999999998,
            534.5,
            661.2499999999998
          ],
          "block_id": "t00027",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "准确性评估可采用抽样核查、规则校验和对比分析等方法。抽样核查应随机抽取样本，与权威数据源比",
          "parent_id": "h0009",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            661.2499999999998,
            545.0,
            677.5249999999997
          ],
          "block_id": "t00027",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "对；规则校验应定义业务规则，检查数据是否符合；对比分析应比较不同来源的数据一致性。评估频率应",
          "parent_id": "h0009",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "box": [
            62.0,
            677.5249999999997,
            450.5,
            693.7999999999997
          ],
          "block_id": "t00027",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "根据数据重要性和变化程度确定。评估结果应记录并分析误差原因，制定改进措施。",
          "parent_id": "h0009",
          "level": null,
          "size": 10.5,
          "font": "cjk",
          "lane": "column0",
          "color_hex": null
        }
      ]
